{"id":"bote","lemma":"bote","pos":"noun","rank":1322,"glosses":["boat, dinghy","vessel, can, canister, container, jar, tin","jackpot, pot, pool (large cash prize)"],"ipa":"/ˈbote/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"botes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-bote.wav","examples":[{"text":"Nuestro bote se hundió.","en":"Our boat sank.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/722242"},{"text":"Hay algunos botes en el lago.","en":"There are a few boats on the lake.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/615940"},{"text":"Estamos en el mismo bote.","en":"We're in the same boat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461054"},{"text":"¿Dónde están los botes salvavidas?","en":"Where are the lifeboats?"},{"text":"¿Tienes un bote de pesca?","en":"Do you have a fishing boat?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515098"}]}